{"id": "7th-t2-u2-q239", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "7", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "2", "unit_id": "ta-t2-u2-kalai", "lesson_id": "lesson-11-thirukkural", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ta-t2-u2-match-kural-glossary", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "குறட்பாச் சொற்களையும் பொருள்களையும் பொருத்துக:\n(a) கசடற - 1. செல்வம்\n(b) மாடு - 2. குற்றம்\n(c) இழுக்கு - 3. பிழை இல்லாமல்\n(d) இடும்பை - 4. துன்பம்"}], "options": {"A": "a-1, b-2, c-3, d-4", "B": "a-4, b-1, c-2, d-3", "C": "a-3, b-1, c-2, d-4", "D": "a-3, b-4, c-1, d-2"}, "explanation": "கசடற = பிழை இல்லாமல் (3); மாடு = செல்வம் ('மாடல்ல மற்றை யவை') (1); இழுக்கு = குற்றம் (2); இடும்பை = துன்பம் (4). வரிசை: 3, 1, 2, 4."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match Thirukkural vocabulary with their meanings:\n(a) Kasadara - 1. Wealth\n(b) Maadu - 2. Flaw / Fault\n(c) Izhukku - 3. Without flaw\n(d) Idumbai - 4. Sorrow / Calamity"}], "options": {"A": "a-1, b-2, c-3, d-4", "B": "a-4, b-1, c-2, d-3", "C": "a-3, b-1, c-2, d-4", "D": "a-3, b-4, c-1, d-2"}, "explanation": "Kasadara = without fault (3); Maadu = wealth (1); Izhukku = flaw (2); Idumbai = distress (4). Match: 3, 1, 2, 4 (C)."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [{"id": "L1", "content_ta": "கசடற", "content_en": "Kasadara"}, {"id": "L2", "content_ta": "மாடு", "content_en": "Maadu"}, {"id": "L3", "content_ta": "இழுக்கு", "content_en": "Izhukku"}, {"id": "L4", "content_ta": "இடும்பை", "content_en": "Idumbai"}], "right": [{"id": "R1", "content_ta": "செல்வம்", "content_en": "Wealth"}, {"id": "R2", "content_ta": "குற்றம்", "content_en": "Flaw / Fault"}, {"id": "R3", "content_ta": "பிழை இல்லாமல்", "content_en": "Without flaw"}, {"id": "R4", "content_ta": "துன்பம்", "content_en": "Sorrow / Calamity"}]}, "ord